'''Bento Region''' (ン・トーベ地方 ''N Tōbe Chihō'', '''N Tōbe Region''') is the 33rd sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 131st sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
A rather straightforward sub-chapter, the stages aren't that easy but also aren't that difficult. The hardest stage will likely be the fifth, [[Smoked Salmon Run]], which has [[Aku Cyclone]] supported by [[:Category:Death Surge Enemies|Death Surge enemies]] and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], including [[Deathshund]] and [[Dread Bore]].

==New Features==
This sub-chapter reintroduces 1 enemy to Zero Legends:

*[[Aku Cyclone]]: Originally from [[The Great Diablo]], this [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemy moves very slowly, has 4 knockbacks and deals relatively low damage for a [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]], but is extremely tanky, with a [[Shield]] that has as much health as the Cyclone itself (1,999,999 at the 120% buff it appears with in Zero Legends) and 100% regeneration.

